<description>&lt;p&gt;A machete-wielding mob killed a nurse and wounded a health worker while they responded to an Ebola alert in eastern DRC. Uganda tightened its border as the outbreak spread, and a DRC legislator failed to persuade SADC to isolate President Kabila, prompting a South African envoy to call for inclusive dialogue. DRC forces recaptured strategic territory from a rebel group led by an ex-president. The conflict produced 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA0UHltUWxpb2RGV3hhRTZzdXRKLXZlcktvOE5ZeE1nX0JNaGF0Nm92bzlFamI1TlJGWXlNRjdPWkh6UXZuNTN1Z3BNeHlfYnI1SzB2OEpFMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OMkE2ckFEdi04enBjZXVsekphLTVqVkRacVdKMzhuQ1RrNHByZjFOOEkxbEd5akFXUVdlV1hnWkRaN056RHRuRUtQYUIwYVk0Q1pqTFRuVUI5WXV3cEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1MdjdPTmU1RjFaWWhOdFd1bHE3LVpNTFF0OW5LZm1VcGJ5cW5GQzFYeVNpdS1OaG5vMXNOeXJoSUdOcnpJdU9lU0pfNlRUbi1CVkNTOU9PRFhNcXM4RnNZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE40SWxzZV9fRV9fQ3JGaUdGSjhHZkJ3ZjJGaTJrakM2ZzZOSHpadDVBUlJhb0swTzBhUm5FSk5wbl84UUxFd3JiS0Q1LXdsTGxrRHM2cHM4UUt5NXRGZ3JFS0RYQzZQVlZTMk5rak9id3RvSG0yUDdwU0dzSzlzSFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQMjBjMURXOWwxQThxNnBUSUx1R1hSQUdNWkJsSlN6cnRQaGdFV1pTMUpwZE9hZnZmcnVYb2NTOTZpd3psdlFMczN2X05FeUVOMFdMNkhmR2FDN2w5eTlYZWkwWGtubWNnc3QzYlMxNWpTcEU0OW5MeE9kMmJDS0dleG44S0hNODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h